    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U03-L02-ACTIVITY-012",
      "SourceSection": "2.3: Cube It",
      "SourceExcerpt": "\\(\\sqrt[3]{1,\\!200}\\) is between 10 and 11 because \\(10^3 = 1,\\!000\\) and \\(11^3 = 1,\\!331\\). Determine the whole numbers that each of these cube roots lies between:",
      "SourceLessonArtifact": "src/Edulytics.Core/Curriculum/LessonContent/RichV2/us-ccss-hs-alg2-u03-l02.rich-lesson-v2.json",
